<title>USA: La Quinta Inns CFO to leave company.</title>
<headline>La Quinta Inns CFO to leave company.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Quinta Inns Inc said chief financial officer William Hammett will leave the company effective September 12.</p>
<p>The company said Hammett plans to relocate to Charlotte, N.C. in the near future.</p>
<p>La Quinta said it has begun a search to find a replacement.</p>
